  TITLE     Identification of PCTA, a TGIF antagonist that promotes PML
            function in TGF-beta signalling
  JOURNAL   EMBO J 27 (13), 1804-1815 (2008)
   PUBMED   18511908
  REMARK    GeneRIF: PCTA (IRF2BP1) defines a new component of the TGF-beta
            signalling pathway that functions to facilitate Smad2
            phosphorylation through controlling the accumulation of cPML into
            the cytoplasm, and consequently, the assembly of Smad2-receptor
            complex.
